The chart room, next morning. The remains of dinner. The DUKE asleep in a chair. The DUCHESS, fresh, pours coffee for MORDECAI, who looks as if he did not sleep.

DUCHESS
You were up early.

MORDECAI
I was up late. I walked back along the cliff. You can see the beam from everywhere.

DUCHESS
That is rather the point of it.

MORDECAI
The Admiral thinks it’s a candle on a rock.

DUKE
(waking)
Candle? Who said candle? It’s a first-order dioptric apparatus!

DUCHESS
Go back to sleep, dear.

DUKE
(sleeping again)
First-order.

MORDECAI
Your grace, if I were to write that the light should stay—

DUCHESS
Then you would be going home on Friday with a report nobody wanted.

MORDECAI
Yes.

DUCHESS
Mr Finch, I have been married thirty years. Most of the reports that matter are the ones nobody wanted.

> INTERVAL.
